 an agent workspace (no account required)","description":"Anonymous, single-call onboarding for AI agents: returns a durable unclaimed workspace and a workspace-scoped `mcpkey_` API key with no signup, email, or human involvement. Use the returned key immediately as `x-api-key` on the generation endpoints, or as a bearer token against the MCP endpoint in `mcp_url`. The workspace runs on the agent plan with the generation allowance in `limits`, and is reaped after `limits.expires_after_idle_days` of no authenticated use. When a claim link is returned, hand it to your human: opening it in a browser transfers ownership of the workspace and everything generated in it to their account.","security":[],"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ApiVersion"}],"requestBody":{"required":false,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AgentOnboardingRequest"}}}}}},"/api/generation/capabilities":{"get":{"responses":{"200":{"description":"The caller-visible generation capability catalog.","headers":{"RateLimit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit"},"RateLimit-Policy":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimitPolicy"},"RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimitLimit"},"RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimitRemaining"},"RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimitReset"},"X-RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimitLimit"},"X-RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimitRemaining"},"X-RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimitReset"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GenerationCapabilitiesResponse"}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Conflict"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/co